# NAME: Claude Supplement
# AUTHOR: rrxl
# REPO: https://github.com/rrxl/shadowrocket-rule-supplement
# UPDATED: 2026-11-01
# DESCRIPTION: Supplement rules for blackmatrix7 Claude.list
# BASE: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Shadowrocket/Claude/Claude.list

# Claude first-party domains missing from upstream
# Sources: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/desktop (claude.app)
#          https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community/blob/master/data/anthropic (claude.dev)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clau.de
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.new
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeacademy.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudepages.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com

# 2026-11-01: claude.site publishes Artifacts; claudeacademy.com redirects
# to academy.claude.com; claude.new and claudepages.dev are present in
# active v2fly provider data and hosted by Anthropic's infrastructure.
# CDN, authentication and content services not covered by anthropic.com
DOMAIN,servd-anthropic-website.b-cdn.net
DOMAIN,anthropic.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,anthropic.auth0.com
DOMAIN,anthropic-com.ghost.io

# Claude Code telemetry and feature delivery
# Keep shared third-party services exact to avoid capturing other apps.
DOMAIN,cdn.growthbook.io
DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com
# Sentry and generic statsigapi.net rules are intentionally omitted:
# Sentry is shared by many apps, while Claude Code Statsig telemetry uses
# statsig.anthropic.com, already covered by the upstream anthropic.com suffix.

# Anthropic network fallback (current AS399358 announcements)
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/23,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,2607:6bc0::/48,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,2607:6bc0:11::/48,no-resolve
IP-ASN,399358,no-resolve
